{"id":66946,"date":"2022-07-21T18:14:12","date_gmt":"2022-07-21T12:44:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/?post_type=astra-sites&#038;p=66946"},"modified":"2022-12-19T17:44:49","modified_gmt":"2022-12-19T12:14:49","slug":"electric-scooter","status":"publish","type":"astra-sites","link":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/astra-site\/electric-scooter\/","title":{"rendered":"Electric Scooter"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The Electric Scooter template is an eCommerce design with a contemporary feel. It opens with a large product section and unfolds into a wide open store template with a parallax effect that works incredibly well.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The design uses open design and feels welcoming and engaging. Combined with high quality images, modern fonts and plenty of whitespace, there\u2019s a professional feel to this template. Ideal for new stores or those dealing with big ticket items.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key features of the Electric Scooter template<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Modern eCommerce templates with modern touches<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Neutral colors and modern fonts<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Open design with lots of whitespace<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fully compatible with WooCommerce<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full compatibility with leading page builders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Modern eCommerce design with an open light feel ideal for online stores<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":165,"featured_media":66950,"template":"","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"",